. You start in your home region, and the farther you travel, the stronger the creatures get and the better the materials you find. There are no classes. There are nine paths, among them fighter, merchant, scholar, explorer and diplomat, and each one leve","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:30:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691808","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:27:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4898190-1844751498223660","game_id":"steam-4898190","kind":"announcement","title":"The Erevael Demo is Live!","summary":"The Erevael demo is out. It's free, and the character you make in it carries over to the full game when it launches on November 10th. Erevael is a fantasy RPG on a hex map that's different every game. You reveal the world, take jobs from the guild, fight turn-based battles and craft through minigames. There are no classes. Your character improves based on your play style. What's in the demo Your home region and one adjacent region Four species and 12 backstories to pick from Turn-based combat ag","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T07:48:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498223660","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:27:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4898190":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:13:38Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:13:37Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4898190":"2026-10-26T15:13:38Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4898190":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:13:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:13:37Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:13:37Z"},"5156210":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:13:38Z"